B"}, {"file_name": "06_vault_cracked_club.png", "id": "1023643870566406", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1023643873899739_5396471792898162736_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T2XLER6swI0Q7kNvwG-3QWJ&_nc_oc=AdoY0yRrsuz7Acos3r7iFXo2PjHytCM71lpF4K4o5LyJBpqHtzjxPS4q20ERrAWg87E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJRzR-9UK0mRlpHnzvsVV5uMoGe4uV5-m-6lglg5wTJBA&oe=6AA3FF60"}, {"file_name": "07_theme_pink.png", "id": "921808227600850", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_921808230934183_3497660381919990941_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=93H_D73w0yUQ7kNvwHTeGc6&_nc_oc=AdosBoJCy-mtELRd-v-PAEmuMF1sNUbfQRU2F24Bm4QR6nRv1rgdnjhevqdAAwwhHu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJdYkt9g6vIqo7e9REBvlkpwEeAjl9LenMuuk7HEXq7Qg&oe=6AA40F83"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Finally VR Video Player", "keywords": ["video", "player", "VR180", "SMB", "8K"], "long_description": "```\nFinally \u2014 a VR video player built the way it should have been all along.\n\nPoint it at your own collection and press play. Finally indexes local files and streams straight from your network drives (SMB) \u2014 no uploads, no accounts, no subscriptions.\n\n**Plays everything, properly.**\n- Hardware-accelerated playback up to 8K\n- VR180, VR360, fisheye, flat, and SBS/TB stereo\n- Automatic projection detection with a manual override that sticks\n- Photos and stills in the same library\n\n**Built for the headset.**\n- Native OpenXR immersive theater with a clean cockpit\n- True scene dolly \u2014 move closer without breaking world scale\n- Refresh-rate matching for judder-free 24/30/60 fps\n- One-controller friendly: everything reachable from one hand\n\n**Mixed reality, done right.**\n- Alpha-packed AR video plays in your real room, not a black void\n- Four simultaneous chroma keys with independent tolerance, softness, and spill\n- In-headset color picker: point the laser, click, it's keyed\n- Passthrough lobby: browse your vault with the room visible\n\n**Your library, your rules.**\n- Local storage and SMB shares as first-class sources\n- Resume positions, per-title settings, fast vault browser\n- No telemetry, no analytics, no ads\n\nIf you have a media collection and a Quest, this is the player you've been waiting for.\n```\n", "short_description": "The VR video player that respects your library. Local files and network shares, 8K playback, VR180/360/fisheye, and zero accounts required."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://coldbricks.github.io/finally/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coldbricks", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://coldbricks.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1150511761487601"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1549908803299978"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1549908803299978"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1784388180, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1549908803299978"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1237193169486126", "version": "1.0.30"}, "id": "1762694784946602", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1150511758154268", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1237193169486126"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1762694784946602"}]}, "change_log": "Finally 1.0.30\r\n\r\n- Controllers in front of the menu stay visible instead of being cut off by the panel.\r\n- Lobby HELP now includes illustrated articles and controller diagrams for your platform.\r\n- All Help topics stay visible while you scroll the selected article.\r\n- Read longer articles with PAGE UP, PAGE DOWN or the thumbstick.\r\n- Lobby Help keeps its own topic and reading position, separate from playback Help.\r\n\r\nLean native OpenXR for Quest and Galaxy XR.", "created_date": 1788720509, "id": "1237193169486126", "version": "1.0.30", "version_code": 121, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1150511758154268", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1237193169486126"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1762694784946602"}]}, "change_log": "Finally 1.0.29\n\n- Easier-to-find SOURCES with clear headset and computer/NAS choices.\n- Simpler SMB sign-in and optional advanced settings.\n- Back returns to the Lobby after canceling setup.\n- Clearer DLNA access messages and improved SMB recovery.\n- Cleaner scan cancellation and local folder handling.\n- Better audio-language fallback and delayed subtitles.\n- Correct reset defaults; pending view resets cancel when paused.\n- Browser handoffs stop when you leave.", "created_date": 1788710912, "id": "1237007109504732", "version": "1.0.29", "version_code": 120, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1150511758154268", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1237193169486126"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1762694784946602"}]}, "change_log": "Finally VR Video Player 1.0.28\r\n\r\n- Improved local photo and video thumbnails, including one-eye previews for stereo photos.\r\n- Kept the Lobby list visible while sorting, without brief empty-library prompts.\r\n- Added Gentle, Normal and Fast stick response in Global Settings. Gentle is the default.\r\n- Reduced unnecessary scrolling in BASIC playback controls.\r\n- Improved photo chroma picking and duplicate-key transparency. Harmonize now matches the interface without changing picture colors.\r\n- Improved high-frame-rate pacing and MPEG-2 video compatibility, timing and aspect ratio.\r\n- Kept room and passthrough backgrounds visible while switching photos.\r\n- Made Stats refresh-rate reporting more accurate.\r\n- Improved the handoff from the intro to the immersive Lobby.\r\n\r\nLean native OpenXR playback for Quest.", "created_date": 1788590569, "id": "1234732353065541", "version": "1.0.28", "version_code": 119, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1150511758154268", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1237193169486126"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1762694784946602"}]}, "change_log": "Finally VR Video Player 1.0.27\r\n\r\n- Fixed DLNA folder and media-filter dialogs that could hide their rows.\r\n- Improved video selection when a server supplies thumbnails, subtitles, and an extensionless video stream together.\r\n- Kept MKV filename detection working with application container MIME types.\r\n- Fixed indexing that could stop early when a server returns small pages, leaving later videos undiscovered.\r\n\r\nLean native OpenXR playback for Quest.", "created_date": 1788566140, "id": "1234330686439041", "version": "1.0.27", "version_code": 118, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1150511758154268", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1237193169486126"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1762694784946602"}]}, "change_log": "Finally VR Video Player 1.0.26\r\n\r\n- Creator notebook: save named timecodes, jump back to a moment while paused, and export your viewing recipe.\r\n- Compare neutral: temporarily compare the picture without your color adjustments, then restore your grade.\r\n- Browse large libraries in smaller pages, with search and selection across the catalog.\r\n- FIND supports system-keyboard entry, paste, and more languages.\r\n- Preserve authored chapter names and use indexed seek previews when matching preview files are available.\r\n- Temporary sessions skip new resume, Recently Played, and automatic playback receipt updates. Existing records stay.\r\n- Continue adding a source after granting access, restore a room saved at 0% brightness, and see clearer buffering feedback.\r\n- Bounded thumbnail work helps keep background media extraction under control.\r\n\r\nTemporary sessions do not erase files, caches, viewing settings, explicit notebook edits, or server activity. They do not encrypt videos.\r\n\r\nLean native OpenXR playback for Quest.", "created_date": 1788562705, "id": "1234278809777562", "version": "1.0.26", "version_code": 117, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}